# Spring Boot Backend Project

A backend application developed using Spring Boot demonstrating REST APIs, backend architecture, and Maven-based project structure.

---

## 🚀 Features

* REST API implementation
* Spring Boot backend architecture
* Maven project setup
* Clean controller-service structure
* JSON request/response handling

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

* Java
* Spring Boot
* Maven
* REST APIs

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```text id="s1apqj"
E-Commerce/
│
├── src/
├── pom.xml
└── README.md
```

---

## ▶️ How To Run

### 1. Clone Repository

```bash id="9ttml2"
git clone https://github.com/ayush004-singh/E-Commerce-.git
```

### 2. Open Project

Open in IntelliJ IDEA or VS Code.

### 3. Run Application

```bash id="1qk1qa"
mvn spring-boot:run
```

